She doesn't get to hear you enough.

494
00:29:51,780 --> 00:29:52,980
She's like, what is this all about?

495
00:29:54,419 --> 00:29:55,500
What is this all about?

496
00:29:58,500 --> 00:30:00,440
Well, this is – it's terribly important.

497
00:30:00,580 --> 00:30:02,399
It's an international thing, you know.

498
00:30:02,899 --> 00:30:06,040
So – at least that's what I tell my wife.

499
00:30:06,639 --> 00:30:06,860
Okay.

500
00:30:07,179 --> 00:30:09,060
She still doesn't really believe me, but –

501
00:30:09,060 --> 00:30:16,419
So, once again, thanks very much, Larry, and I'll look forward to hearing from you soon.

